what have i got 10 days from now\"], [\"I keep forgetting this at the gym, so the locker combination is 41539 — could you stash that in the locker for me?\", \"Different thing — I want to know what I've still got to get through, so what's still due this weekend?\", \"Oh and I'm trying to budget for presents, so whose birthdays are coming up in the next two months?\", \"Hmm, I only care about one of those really — can you just pull up the third one on its own?\", \"Also, I'm trying to plan ahead a bit, so what do I have on 10 days from now?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w30-0057\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how many events I have tomorrow, please?\", \"Actually, never mind that — I'll check it myself later, thank you.\"], [\"I'm trying to figure out if I'll have time to sort the garden, so how many events have I got tomorrow?\", \"Ah, scrap that actually, I'm running out the door anyway, I'll have a look myself later on.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w30-0058\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which events I have tomorrow, please?\", \"Also, could you tell me what time the elbow repair is?\", \"Would you please add a task to print the elbow booking on tuesday?\", \"Different question — when did I last speak to Sefo Wanjala?\", \"And could you check whether there are any Vaivio entries in my locker, please?\"], [\"umm which… which events have I got tomorrow?\", \"oh and uh what time's the elbow repair?\", \"ok can you make me a task to, um, print the elbow booking tuesday\", \"hmm when did I last, like, talk to Sefo Wanjala?\", \"oh and are there any uh Vaivio entries in my locker?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w30-0059\", \"v\": [[\"I need to get a gift sorted and I've totally lost track of dates, so when is the meadowsweet party?\", \"Great, and while I've got you, what about the look — when's that one?\"], [\"meadowsweet party when?\", \"and the look?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w30-0060\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what my spending came to last week, please?\"], [\"how much did i spend last week\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0001\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's planned for wednesday, please?\", \"And what about the 14th?\", \"Could you please move the first one an hour later?\", \"Sorry, that was the wrong one — I meant the second one.\", \"Separately, which expenses are in the rudder club group?\", \"And could you tell me what's still left on my to-do list?\"], [\"umm what've I got planned for wednesday?\", \"ok and uh the 14th?\", \"can you push the first one, um, an hour later\", \"oh no wait, wrong one, I meant the second one\", \"ok different thing, what expenses are in the, uh, rudder club group?\", \"and um what's left on my to-do list?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0002\", \"v\": [[\"pics with Magda\"], [\"Could you please show me the photos that have Magda in them?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0003\", \"v\": [[\"save locker combination 21254 in the locker pls\", \"also settle up w everyone in rudder club\", \"can u log Chetan, i texted him\", \"hynmere one\", \"what do the rudder expenses add up to\"], [\"Could you please save the locker combination 21254 in my locker?\", \"Also, would you settle up with everyone in the rudder club, please?\", \"Could you please log an interaction with Chetan? I texted him.\", \"It was Chetan Hynmere, thank you.\", \"Also, could you tell me what the rudder expenses add up to?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0004\", \"v\": [[\"how much have i spent in rudder club\"], [\"umm how much have I spent in, uh, rudder club?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0005\", \"v\": [[\"so what've I… what have I been spending on in rudder club?\"], [\"Could you show me the expenses I've had in rudder club, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0007\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me who I'm seeing at the paperweight, please?\", \"And who else is coming, apart from Vrilie?\"], [\"I want to know who to expect when I get there, so who am I seeing at the paperweight?\", \"Right, I already knew about Vrilie, but I'm curious — who else is coming apart from Vrilie?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0009\", \"v\": [[\"settle w Crolkuwyn in origami pot pls\"], [\"um can you square things up with Crolkuwyn in the, uh, origami pot?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0011\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I spent on rudder in total?\", \"Also, who do I owe money to?\", \"Hang on — could you show me the notes in my Ideas notebook?\", \"Right, back to the money — which of those are above twelve euros?\"], [\"how much did i spend on rudder altogether\", \"who do i owe money to\", \"wait quick one, show me my Ideas notebook notes\", \"ok back to the money, which of those r over twelve euros\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w31-0012\", \"v\": [[\"origami pot — how much spent?\", \"Deepika visit today, log it\", \"forty five minute task?\"], [\"I'm trying to get a handle on the group spending, so in origami pot, how much have I spent so far?\", \"Oh and I popped round to see Deepika today — could you log that as a visit for me?\", \"I've got a short gap I want to fill with something useful, so which task is roughly a forty five minute job?\"]]}","ttft_ms":26959,"type":"result","duration_ms":39921,"uuid":"cdd576ff-ddff-4aaa-9258-6744e05faea8","ttft_stream_ms":1289,"time_to_request_ms":194,"first_content_frame_ms":1290,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22414564,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278965168.0845,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
